      </nav>
      <div class="hero__overlay">
        <p class="eyebrow">Wolverine Stack in Denver</p>
        <h1>Wolverine Stack in Denver for Recovery That Keeps Up.</h1>
        <p class="hero__summary">
          The Wolverine Stack, BPC-157 + TB-500, is a clinician-guided peptide protocol
          for Denver-area adults who want to support mobility, soft-tissue recovery, and
          an active life that still feels like theirs.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__expect">
          <h3>Start before another season of slow recovery:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Recovery consults for Denver + Greenwood Village patients</li>
            <li>Subcutaneous BPC-157 + TB-500 protocol review</li>
            <li>Clear next steps, pricing, and eligibility before you start</li>
            <li>Limited weekly consult availability for new peptide patients</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__actions" aria-label="Primary actions">
